{
  "title": "Global Accelerator · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "고정된 글로벌 진입점에서 정상 AWS 엔드포인트로 트래픽을 보냅니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Global Accelerator</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#guide-1\">글로벌 진입점 구성</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#guide-2\">적합한 요구사항</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>27 / 62</span></div><h1>Global Accelerator</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Global Accelerator는 <strong>글로벌 고정 IP를 서비스 진입점으로 제공하고, AWS 네트워크를 통해 적절한 엔드포인트로 트래픽을 전달하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 여러 리전의 서비스에 접근하는 경로와 장애 대응을 관리할 수 있습니다.</p><p>사용자는 같은 진입점으로 연결하고, 서비스는 엔드포인트 상태와 설정에 따라 트래픽을 받습니다. 콘텐츠를 캐시하는 CloudFront와는 제공하는 기능이 다릅니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"standard-accelerator\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"static-ip-addresses\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"listeners-and-endpoint-groups\"></span><h2>글로벌 진입점 구성</h2><p>처리할 프로토콜과 포트를 리스너에 설정하고 리전별 엔드포인트 그룹을 만듭니다. 지원되는 로드 밸런서나 EC2 등을 엔드포인트로 등록합니다.</p><p>상태 확인 결과와 트래픽 설정에 따라 정상 대상으로 연결을 보냅니다. 사용자와 AWS 접점 사이 이후의 경로에 AWS 글로벌 네트워크를 활용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"health-checks-and-failover\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"custom-routing-accelerator\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"global-accelerator-and-cloudfront\"></span><h2>적합한 요구사항</h2><p>접속 IP를 허용 목록에 등록해야 하거나, 여러 리전의 TCP·UDP 서비스에 안정적인 진입점이 필요할 때 검토합니다.</p><p>애플리케이션 데이터 복제와 세션 처리는 별도로 설계합니다. 트래픽을 다른 리전으로 보낼 수 있어도 그 리전의 애플리케이션이 실제 요청을 처리할 준비가 되어 있어야 합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>글로벌 요청 전달</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>고정 진입점</strong><span>사용자 연결</span></li><li><strong>AWS 글로벌 네트워크</strong><span>상태·설정에 따라 전달</span></li><li><strong>리전별 엔드포인트</strong><span>애플리케이션 처리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">진입점은 유지하면서 뒤쪽 서비스의 위치와 정상 상태에 따라 연결을 전달합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>여러 리전에서 실행하는 게임 서버에 고정된 진입 IP를 제공합니다. 장애가 있는 리전 대신 정상 엔드포인트로 신규 연결을 전달하도록 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/global-accelerator/latest/dg/what-is-global-accelerator.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS Global Accelerator? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q025\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q025\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q025</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs fixed IP addresses and optimized routing to healthy TCP endpoints in multiple Regions. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Transfer Acceleration alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront object caching alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Global Accelerator</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a>는 anycast 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 글로벌 네트워크를 활용해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>로 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q033\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q033\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q033</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q033/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service requires TCP connections and fixed IP addresses but does not need HTTP path routing. Which load balancer should be considered first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>는 L4 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>/UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> 연결 요구와 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 요구에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q023\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q024\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q082\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">이전 용어 <b>FSx</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">다음 용어 <b>IAM</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
